#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_us_sales_tax_engine_origin_sourcing.field_res_config_settings__us_tax_sourcing
msgid ""
"Address used by default to rate the US sales tax of new sales orders and "
"customer invoices. Destination: the customer's delivery address. Origin: the"
" company address, except for customers outside the United States. It can be "
"changed on each draft document."
msgstr ""

